    "body": "Ah! This can now be removed, as InitializeHostDefinedRealm has been split into two parts. Formerly, the stuff in [RunJobs](https://tc39.github.io/ecma262/#sec-runjobs) was also there, and we wanted to explicitly state how we did not plan to use it.\n\nI think abstracting it out into something shared would be useful, yeah. However once you start de-duplicating those steps I'm not sure it should stop at InitializeHostDefinedRealm. A lot of the surrounding steps also look duplicated.\n",
